    "message": "Update terraform-policy skill for tfpolicy 0.1.x and 0.2.0+ compatibility (#97)\n\n* docs(terraform-policy): add tfpolicy version-aware guidance\n\n* docs(terraform-policy): reduce required_providers duplication\n\n* docs(terraform-policy): trim redundant validation guidance\n\n* fix: update broken links in refactor-module to new plugin structure\n\n* docs(terraform-policy): replace hardcoded AWS version with reasoning and example\n\n- Add comments explaining why version constraints matter\n- Change from hardcoded 6.0.0 to broader 5.0.0 range as example\n- Add guidance to adjust based on infrastructure\n- Note that other providers can be added\n\nAddresses reviewer feedback on PR #97\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: vpaul97 <v.paul@v.paul-GHRW27M29M>",
